    {
      "id": "sys_hsmr_epa",
      "name": "480 VAC Division A (with BESS backup)",
      "acronym": "EPA",
      "description": "<h3>Function</h3><p>480 VAC Division A (EPA) powers the Division A safety and support loads: the 125 VDC Division A battery charger,\none CVCS makeup pump, one CCW pump and cooling-tower fan, one control room HVAC train and the Division A motor-operated containment isolation valves.</p>\n<h3>Configuration</h3><ul><li>13.8 kV feeder breaker (13.8 kV switchgear room) and an MV cable to a 13.8 kV / 480 V dry-type load-center transformer.</li>\n<li>480 V load-center bus and motor control center in the Division A 480 V switchgear room (separate fire area).</li>\n<li>Battery energy storage system (Li-ion, about 40 MWh) with a grid-forming inverter in its own BESS room, connected through an automatic transfer switch (ATS).</li></ul>\n<h3>Normal and emergency operation</h3><p>Normally fed from offsite power (OSP). On loss of offsite power the ATS transfers the load center to the BESS,\nwhich is sized for 72 hours of the division's essential loads. No diesel generators exist.</p>\n<h3>Success criterion</h3><p>Load center AND MCC AND (offsite path OR BESS path).</p>\n<h3>Dependencies</h3><p>OSP (SUBSYS). The division's loads appear in CVCS, CCW, CRV, CIS and DCA.</p>\n<h3>Evaluation cases</h3><p><b>72-h:</b> mission failure probability (the BESS battery and inverter must work for 72 h if called on).\n<b>1-yr:</b> unavailability: running equipment &lambda;&tau;/(1+&lambda;&tau;); the BESS battery and inverter in standby with a monthly functional test (FM3, &lambda;T/2).</p>\n<h3>Common cause</h3><p>Divisions A and B are separate KUREAS systems, so (by the KUREAS-SYS rule that CCF groups never mix systems) no CCF is generated between the two BESS or the two load centers. See the @uncertainty tag.</p>\n<h3>Data</h3><p>NRC-INL 2020; BESS battery surrogate and fire frequency illustrative. Fire sources in the switchgear and BESS rooms fail the equipment in the same room.</p>",
      "sscsInSystem": [
        {
          "id": 1790000000073,
          "name": "EPA_ELECT_CBK_A",
          "savedId": "EPA-FDR-BKR",
          "description": "13.8 kV feeder breaker to the Division A load-center transformer",
          "label": "High Voltage (13.8/16 kV) Circuit Breaker (CBK)",
          "sscType": "Electrical (ELECT)",
          "system": "480 VAC Division A (with BESS backup)",
          "uniqueLabel": "",
          "trainId": "Train A",
          "moduleId": "",
          "templateId": "tpl_hsmr_hvcb",
          "source": {
            "id": "NRC-INL-2020",
            "name": "NRC-INL 2020 Parameter Estimation",
            "description": "Industry Average Parameter Estimates, 2020 Update, URL https://nrcoe.inl.gov/avgperf/"
          },
          "failureModes": [
            {
              "id": 1790000000021,
              "mode": "SPUR",
              "probabilityType": "probability",
              "applicable": true,
              "lambda": "3.90E-07",
              "failureModel": "2",
              "missionTime": "72",
              "data": {
                "system": "",
