        },
        {
          "type": "eol",
          "value": ";",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "comment",
          "value": "@boundary { From the 13.8 kV feeder breaker (OSP supplies the bus) and from the BESS to the Division B MCC.",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "eol",
          "value": ";",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "comment",
          "value": "  Load cables from the MCC are modeled in the systems that own the loads. }",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "eol",
          "value": ";",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "comment",
          "value": "@basis { The division is powered when its load center and MCC work and either the offsite path or the BESS path works. }",
