      "view3d": {
        "script": "# Protection Sensors (four channels) (SEN): 3D layout of its SSCs in the HSMR-77 buildings.\n# Parts are named with the SSC controlled names, so each part (or GROUP) links to its SSC.\n# Rooms and buildings come from the Project 3D script; cables are WIREs routed through the rooms.\n\nPART SEN_SENS_PRES_1 = CYLINDER(D=0.25, H=1.4) IN RXB_GALLERY AT (-2.4, 0, 4.8) COLOR 0x2bb3c0;\nPART SEN_SWC_BIS_1 = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICA AT (-1.6, 0, 2.6) COLOR 0x6f7a86;\nPART SEN_SENS_PRES_2 = CYLINDER(D=0.25, H=1.4) IN RXB_GALLERY AT (-1.3, 0, 4.8) COLOR 0x2bb3c0;\nPART SEN_SWC_BIS_2 = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICB AT (-1.6, 0, 2.6) COLOR 0x6f7a86;\nPART SEN_SENS_PRES_3 = CYLINDER(D=0.25, H=1.4) IN RXB_GALLERY AT (-0.2, 0, 4.8) COLOR 0x2bb3c0;\nPART SEN_SWC_BIS_3 = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICA AT (0, 0, 2.6) COLOR 0x6f7a86;\nPART SEN_SENS_PRES_4 = CYLINDER(D=0.25, H=1.4) IN RXB_GALLERY AT (0.9, 0, 4.8) COLOR 0x2bb3c0;\nPART SEN_SWC_BIS_4 = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICB AT (0, 0, 2.6) COLOR 0x6f7a86;\n\n# --- cables: power (red), DC (orange), MV (black) and control (purple), routed above the equipment ---\nPART SEN_CABLE_CCBL_1 = WIRE(D=0.025) FROM (11.036, 1.45, -3.2) THROUGH (11.036, 6.75, -3.2), (11.036, 6.75, 27.6), (-0.874, 6.75, 27.6) TO (-0.874, 2.05, 27.6) COLOR purple;\nPART SEN_CABLE_CCBL_2 = WIRE(D=0.025) FROM (12.136, 1.45, -3.2) THROUGH (12.136, 6.805, -3.2), (12.136, 6.805, 37.6), (-0.874, 6.805, 37.6) TO (-0.874, 2.05, 37.6) COLOR purple;\nPART SEN_CABLE_CCBL_3 = WIRE(D=0.025) FROM (13.236, 1.45, -3.2) THROUGH (13.236, 6.86, -3.2), (13.236, 6.86, 27.6), (0.726, 6.86, 27.6) TO (0.726, 2.05, 27.6) COLOR purple;\nPART SEN_CABLE_CCBL_4 = WIRE(D=0.025) FROM (14.336, 1.45, -3.2) THROUGH (14.336, 6.915, -3.2), (14.336, 6.915, 37.6), (0.726, 6.915, 37.6) TO (0.726, 2.05, 37.6) COLOR purple;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH RXB, RXB_GALLERY, RXB_CVCS, CB, CB_MCR, CB_ICA, CB_ICB, CB_DCA, CB_DCB, CB_HVACA, CB_HVACB, EB, EB_MV, EB_LVA, EB_LVB, EB_BESSA, EB_BESSB, AUX, AUX_CCW, TGB, TGB_FW, UHS_STRUCT_POOL;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH SEN_CABLE_*;\n# cables of other systems share the same overhead raceways and risers\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH OSP_CABLE_MVCBL_UAT, EPA_CABLE_MVCBL_A_XFMR, EPA_CABLE_PCBL_A_BESS, EPB_CABLE_MVCBL_B_XFMR, EPB_CABLE_PCBL_B_BESS, DCA_CABLE_DCBL_A_BAT, DCA_CABLE_PCBL_A_BCH, DCB_CABLE_DCBL_B_BAT, DCB_CABLE_PCBL_B_BCH, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_A_TRIP, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MTRIP, RPS_CABLE_DCBL_A_SHT;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH RPS_CABLE_CCBL_B_TRIP, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MTRIP, RPS_CABLE_DCBL_B_SHT, ESA_CABLE_DCBL_A_ESF, ESB_CABLE_DCBL_B_ESF, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV1A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV1B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV2A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV2B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV3A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV3B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV1A;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV1B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV2A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV2B, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_AV1, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_AV2, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MDHRS, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_AV1, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_AV2, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MDHRS, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_MSI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MSI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_MSO;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MSO, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_FWI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_FWI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_FWO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_FWO, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_INJI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_INJI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_INJO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_INJO, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_LTDI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_LTDI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_LTDO;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_LTDO, CVCS_CABLE_PCBL_A, CVCS_CABLE_PCBL_B, CVCS_CABLE_CCBL_B, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_A_PMP, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_B_PMP, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_A_FAN, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_B_FAN, CCW_CABLE_CCBL_B_PMP, CCW_CABLE_CCBL_B_FAN, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_AHU, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_AHU;\nALLOW SEN_CABLE_* WITH CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_CHL, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_CHL, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_DMP, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_DMP, CRV_CABLE_CCBL_B_START, FWS_CABLE_PCBL_COND, FWS_CABLE_MVCBL_A_FWP, FWS_CABLE_MVCBL_B_FWP, FWS_CABLE_CCBL_B_FWP;\n"
      },
