      "view3d": {
        "script": "# ESFAS Division B (ESB): 3D layout of its SSCs in the HSMR-77 buildings.\n# Parts are named with the SSC controlled names, so each part (or GROUP) links to its SSC.\n# Rooms and buildings come from the Project 3D script; cables are WIREs routed through the rooms.\n\nPART ESB_PLC_PRES_B_ESF = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICB AT (1.6, 0, 1.4) COLOR 0x7b4fb5;\nPART ESB_SWC_RLY_B_ESF = BOX(W=0.8, H=2.0, L=0.6) IN CB_ICB AT (1.6, 0, 0.2) COLOR 0x9aa7b4;\n\n# --- cables: power (red), DC (orange), MV (black) and control (purple), routed above the equipment ---\nPART ESB_CABLE_DCBL_B_ESF = WIRE(D=0.045) FROM (7.971, 1.65, 32.2) THROUGH (7.971, 7.355, 32.2), (2.326, 7.355, 32.2), (2.326, 7.355, 36.4) TO (2.326, 2.05, 36.4) COLOR orange;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH RXB, RXB_GALLERY, RXB_CVCS, CB, CB_MCR, CB_ICA, CB_ICB, CB_DCA, CB_DCB, CB_HVACA, CB_HVACB, EB, EB_MV, EB_LVA, EB_LVB, EB_BESSA, EB_BESSB, AUX, AUX_CCW, TGB, TGB_FW, UHS_STRUCT_POOL;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH ESB_CABLE_*;\n# cables of other systems share the same overhead raceways and risers\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH OSP_CABLE_MVCBL_UAT, EPA_CABLE_MVCBL_A_XFMR, EPA_CABLE_PCBL_A_BESS, EPB_CABLE_MVCBL_B_XFMR, EPB_CABLE_PCBL_B_BESS, DCA_CABLE_DCBL_A_BAT, DCA_CABLE_PCBL_A_BCH, DCB_CABLE_DCBL_B_BAT, DCB_CABLE_PCBL_B_BCH, SEN_CABLE_CCBL_1, SEN_CABLE_CCBL_2, SEN_CABLE_CCBL_3;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH SEN_CABLE_CCBL_4, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_A_TRIP, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MTRIP, RPS_CABLE_DCBL_A_SHT, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_B_TRIP, RPS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MTRIP, RPS_CABLE_DCBL_B_SHT, ESA_CABLE_DCBL_A_ESF, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV1A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV1B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV2A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV2B;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV3A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RVV3B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV1A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV1B, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV2A, ECCS_CABLE_CCBL_RRV2B, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_AV1, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_AV2, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MDHRS, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_AV1, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_AV2, DHRS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MDHRS;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_MSI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_MSI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_MSO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_MSO, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_FWI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_FWI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_FWO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_FWO, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_INJI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_INJI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_INJO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_INJO;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH CIS_CABLE_PCBL_A_LTDI, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_A_LTDI, CIS_CABLE_PCBL_B_LTDO, CIS_CABLE_CCBL_B_LTDO, CVCS_CABLE_PCBL_A, CVCS_CABLE_PCBL_B, CVCS_CABLE_CCBL_B, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_A_PMP, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_B_PMP, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_A_FAN, CCW_CABLE_PCBL_B_FAN, CCW_CABLE_CCBL_B_PMP;\nALLOW ESB_CABLE_* WITH CCW_CABLE_CCBL_B_FAN, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_AHU, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_AHU, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_CHL, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_CHL, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_A_DMP, CRV_CABLE_PCBL_B_DMP, CRV_CABLE_CCBL_B_START, FWS_CABLE_PCBL_COND, FWS_CABLE_MVCBL_A_FWP, FWS_CABLE_MVCBL_B_FWP, FWS_CABLE_CCBL_B_FWP;\n"
      },
