    {
      "id": "sys_hsmr_eccs",
      "name": "Emergency Core Cooling System",
      "acronym": "ECCS",
      "description": "<h3>Function</h3><p>The Emergency Core Cooling System (ECCS) of HSMR-77 is passive: the reactor vent valves (RVVs) open to vent steam from the reactor\npressure vessel (RPV) into the containment vessel (CNV), where it condenses on the cold CNV wall (cooled by the pool); the reactor recirculation valves (RRVs)\nopen to let the condensate flow back into the RPV. No pumps are needed.</p>\n<h3>Configuration</h3><ul><li>Three RVVs on the RPV upper head and two RRVs on the lower RPV, all inside the CNV.</li>\n<li>Each main valve has two trip (pilot) solenoid valves, one actuated by ESFAS Division A and one by Division B, each with its own actuation cable from the Control Building.</li>\n<li>The steel CNV submerged in the reactor pool.</li></ul>\n<h3>Success criterion</h3><p>1 of 3 RVVs AND 1 of 2 RRVs AND the CNV intact AND the pool (UHS).</p>\n<h3>Dependencies</h3><p>ESA and ESB (which bring SEN and DCA / DCB), and UHS.</p>\n<h3>Evaluation cases</h3><p>All active failure modes are on demand, so the 72-h and 1-yr results differ mainly through the DC power (battery\nin standby vs. 72-h mission), the CNV structural rate, the cable rates and the special (seismic, fire) failure modes.</p>\n<h3>Common cause</h3><p>The five main valves share one template (one CCF group of five) and the ten trip solenoids another (one CCF group of ten).</p>",
      "sscsInSystem": [
        {
          "id": 1790000000273,
          "name": "ECCS_VALVE_HOV_RVV1",
          "savedId": "ECCS-RVV1",
          "description": "ECCS reactor vent valve 1 (pilot-operated, opens on reactor pressure when its pilot is vented)",
          "label": "Hydraulic-Operated Valve (HOV)",
          "sscType": "Valve (VALVE)",
          "system": "Emergency Core Cooling System",
          "uniqueLabel": "RVV1",
          "trainId": "",
          "moduleId": "",
          "templateId": "tpl_hsmr_hov",
          "source": {
            "id": "NRC-INL-2020",
            "name": "NRC-INL 2020 Parameter Estimation",
            "description": "Industry Average Parameter Estimates, 2020 Update, URL https://nrcoe.inl.gov/avgperf/"
          },
          "failureModes": [
            {
              "id": 1790000000007,
              "mode": "FTO",
              "probabilityType": "probability",
              "applicable": true,
              "failureModel": "0",
              "data": {
                "system": "",
                "ssc_type": "Valve (VALVE)",
                "component_type": "Hydraulic-Operated Valve (HOV)",
                "failure_mode": "Fails to Open (FTO)",
                "description": "Hydraulic-Operated Valve (HOV) Fails to Open (FTO).",
