    {
      "id": "sys_hsmr_cvcs",
      "name": "Chemical and Volume Control System (makeup)",
      "acronym": "CVCS",
      "description": "<h3>Function</h3><p>The Chemical and Volume Control System (CVCS) provides RCS makeup (and boration) from the makeup tank. In this model only the\nmakeup function is modeled.</p>\n<h3>Configuration</h3><ul><li>Makeup tank, suction header and discharge header in the RXB CVCS room.</li><li>Pump A (normally running, Division A power) and pump B\n(standby, Division B power, auto-started by the plant control system on low flow), each with a discharge check valve.</li>\n<li>Power cables from the division MCCs and an auto-start cable from the CVCS controller in the main control room.</li></ul>\n<h3>Success criterion</h3><p>Tank AND headers AND (train A OR train B) AND CCW.</p>\n<h3>Leakage</h3><p>The makeup tank and both headers have LEAKRATE leak rates in the CVCS 3D script.</p>\n<h3>Evaluation cases</h3><p><b>72-h:</b> pump A must keep running for 72 h; pump B must start and run. <b>1-yr:</b> pump A with repair (FM4, 24 h);\npump B start failure and test-and-maintenance unavailability (its run failures are screened in the 1-yr case).</p>",
      "sscsInSystem": [
        {
          "id": 1790000000421,
          "name": "CVCS_TANK_TANK",
          "savedId": "CVCS-TNK",
          "description": "CVCS makeup (boric acid) storage tank",
          "label": "Tank (TANK)",
          "sscType": "Tank (TANK)",
          "system": "Chemical and Volume Control System (makeup)",
          "uniqueLabel": "",
          "trainId": "",
          "moduleId": "",
          "templateId": "tpl_hsmr_tank",
          "source": {
            "id": "NRC-INL-2020",
            "name": "NRC-INL 2020 Parameter Estimation",
            "description": "Industry Average Parameter Estimates, 2020 Update, URL https://nrcoe.inl.gov/avgperf/"
          },
          "failureModes": [
            {
              "id": 1790000000015,
              "mode": "EXRUPT",
              "probabilityType": "probability",
              "applicable": true,
              "lambda": "8.30E-09",
              "failureModel": "2",
              "missionTime": "72",
              "data": {
                "system": "",
                "ssc_type": "Tank (TANK)",
                "component_type": "Tank (TANK)",
                "failure_mode": "External Rupture (EXRUPT)",
                "description": "Tank (TANK) External Rupture (EXRUPT).",
                "units": "h",
                "mean": "8.30E-09",
                "distribution_type": "Gamma",
                "distribution_shape_parameter": "0.3",
                "distribution_scale_parameter": "3.60E+07"
              },
              "source": "NRC-INL 2020 Parameter Estimation — Industry Average Parameter Estimates, 2020 Update, URL https://nrcoe.inl.gov/avgperf/ (External Rupture (EXRUPT))",
              "sourceRef": {
