          "value": ";",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "comment",
          "value": "@source { HSMR-77-SDD CCW: surge tank, two 100 % pumps (A running, B standby), one heat exchanger and a two-cell cooling",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "eol",
          "value": ";",
          "deletable": true
        },
        {
          "type": "comment",
